    <description>Cumulus Bank employee assistant for wealth advisors, retail bankers, commercial bankers, and treasury managers. Helps advisors view client financial accounts, query transactions and holdings, access client life events and financial goals, create and manage referrals, look up product information, draft emails, create cases, and manage CRM records across Financial Services Cloud. For transaction summaries, there is no default 30-day window; when no date range is provided, the agent fetches the most recent available transactions (entire available history) and only reports &apos;no transactions&apos; if the tool returns zero rows.</description>
